  data: {
    LLM: "1. Bidding: Starts left of dealer. Bids range from 60 to 88 (jumping in increments of 2). Multiples of 88 (176, 264, etc.) are used for aggressive hands.\n2. The Kitty: The high bidder takes the 2 kitty tiles and discards 2 tiles of their choice (cannot discard count tiles into the kitty).\n3. Play: Winner of the bid leads the first tile and names trumps (a specific suit or 'No Trumps').\n4. Identical Tiles: Since there are two sets, if two identical tiles are played in one trick, the FIRST one played wins.",
    Player: "1. Bidding: Starts left of dealer. Bids range from 60 to 88 (jumping in increments of 2). Multiples of 88 (176, 264, etc.) are used for aggressive hands.\n2. The Kitty: The high bidder takes the 2 kitty tiles and discards 2 tiles of their choice (cannot discard count tiles into the kitty).\n3. Play: Winner of the bid leads the first tile and names trumps (a specific suit or 'No Trumps').\n4. Identical Tiles: Since there are two sets, if two identical tiles are played in one trick, the FIRST one played wins.",
    objective: "Score points by winning tricks and capturing 'count' tiles. Be the first team to reach 500 points.",
